  "dek": "A late improvement to 52.92 puts masspeaks back inside public gold; Schweighofer holds the last gold place while Tufa Labs keeps its lead.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Late edition\n\nmasspeaks jumps to ninth at 52.92 after a recorded late improvement from 44.44. ARC-2’s public gold cutoff rises to 47.92; Schweighofer holds that last place after an 11.25-point gain since the previous evening. Tufa Labs leads at 88.06 and ARC Raiders keeps eighth at 62.08. Also: the submission-conditions petition, with proposals clearly separated from organizer decisions. Public medals remain provisional.\n\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-12-evening-arc-2",
